+# Turn Usage Arithmetic
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#93 |
+| Status | Shipped              |
+
+Provider-round usage arithmetic sums each token field from reported rounds, skips missing reports, and leaves a turn with no reported usage undefined ([validated by: sums reported token fields and preserves absent usage — specs/hal-engine-turn-usage/spec.md#1](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.test.ts#L4)).
+
+The turn total includes the provider call that exhausts the tool budget, even though its requested tools are not executed ([validated by: includes the budget-closing provider call in turn usage — specs/hal-engine-turn-usage/spec.md#2](../../src/orchestration/turnUsageContract.test.ts#L6)).
